{"content_hash": "08069dfc5059dadb", "version_id": 873, "article_id": 88, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Storage Hunter Simulator opens garage auctions on PS5 and Xbox", "title_zh": "《仓库猎人模拟器》登陆PS5和Xbox，车库拍卖开抢", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "gcores", "source_url": "https://www.gcores.com/articles/221947", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606813907291-d86efa9b94db?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8OHx8cGxheXN0YXRpb24lMjB4Ym94JTIwc2VyaWVzfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTM4NDI2NTl8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Charles Sims on Unsplash", "author": "Charles Sims", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@1charlessims?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/white-and-black-box-on-white-table-QHha7JOJYnw?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(255, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(293, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "fcb7069c8333"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-05", "word_count": 216, "reading_minutes": 1.1, "lead": "A game about bidding on mystery storage units is coming to consoles. Players will hunt for hidden treasure and build a pawn shop business, alone or with friends.", "lead_zh": "一款竞拍神秘仓库的游戏即将登陆主机平台。玩家可以独自或和朋友一起寻找隐藏的宝贝，并经营自己的典当行生意。", "preview": "Storage Hunter Simulator will arrive on PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S on November 24, 2026, and it will cost $24.99. Players who want th", "preview_zh": "《仓库猎人模拟器》将于2026年11月24日登陆PlayStation 5和Xbox Series X|S，售价24.99美元。想要完整体验拍卖的玩家还可以购买“概不退款版”。该版本包含游戏本体和扩展通行证，通行证里有多个主题DLC，例如《后院入门包》和《收藏品展示包》。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 856, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/88/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 83.725, "size_bytes": 503280, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 250, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8ded7f4/content/data/versions/873.json", "paragraphs": ["Storage Hunter Simulator will arrive on PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S on November 24, 2026, and it will cost $24.99. Players who want the full auction experience can also buy the No Refunds Edition. That version includes the base game and an expansion pass with several themed DLC packs, such as the Backyard Starter Pack and the Collectibles Display Pack.", "The No Refunds Edition will launch on all platforms, including PC, for $34.99. However, the expansion pass is also sold separately for $16.99. In the game, players travel around town to auctions and compete with other bidders for garages, storage rooms and shipping containers. Each auction may hide a surprise, so players must find treasure and turn a profit.", "There are thousands of unique items to discover, and experts can check what they are worth. As the business grows, players unlock tools to value items themselves. They can also buy a pawn shop, upgrade facilities and hire staff, because good resource management matters. The game offers an easy mode and a hard mode, plus achievements to show off.", "You do not have to hunt alone, because up to three friends can join a co-op adventure and drop in or out at any time. Players share one bank account, so teams that plan well will win."], "paragraphs_zh": ["《仓库猎人模拟器》将于2026年11月24日登陆PlayStation 5和Xbox Series X|S，售价24.99美元。想要完整体验拍卖的玩家还可以购买“概不退款版”。该版本包含游戏本体和扩展通行证，通行证里有多个主题DLC，例如《后院入门包》和《收藏品展示包》。", "“概不退款版”将在包括PC在内的所有平台推出，售价34.99美元。不过，扩展通行证也可以单独购买，售价16.99美元。在游戏里，玩家会走遍城镇参加拍卖会，与其他竞拍者争夺车库、储物间和集装箱。每场拍卖都可能藏着惊喜，所以玩家必须发掘宝物才能赚钱。", "游戏中有数千种独特物品等待发现，专家可以鉴定它们的价值。随着生意发展，玩家会解锁自行估价的工具。玩家还能买下典当行、升级设施并雇用员工，因为妥善管理资源很重要。游戏提供轻松和困难两种模式，还有成就可供炫耀。", "你不必独自寻宝，因为最多三位好友可以加入合作冒险，并随时加入或退出。队员们共用一个银行账户，所以计划周全的队伍才能获胜。他们也可以分头前往不同的拍卖现场，从而赚到更多钱。游戏提供七种载具，玩家必须管理好后备箱空间和燃油。"], "body": "Storage Hunter Simulator will arrive on PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S on November 24, 2026, and it will cost $24.99. Players who want the full auction experience can also buy the No Refunds Edition. That version includes the base game and an expansion pass with several themed DLC packs, such as the Backyard Starter Pack and the Collectibles Display Pack.\n\nThe No Refunds Edition will launch on all platforms, including PC, for $34.99. However, the expansion pass is also sold separately for $16.99. In the game, players travel around town to auctions and compete with other bidders for garages, storage rooms and shipping containers. Each auction may hide a surprise, so players must find treasure and turn a profit.\n\nThere are thousands of unique items to discover, and experts can check what they are worth. As the business grows, players unlock tools to value items themselves. They can also buy a pawn shop, upgrade facilities and hire staff, because good resource management matters. The game offers an easy mode and a hard mode, plus achievements to show off.\n\nYou do not have to hunt alone, because up to three friends can join a co-op adventure and drop in or out at any time. Players share one bank account, so teams that plan well will win.", "body_zh": "《仓库猎人模拟器》将于2026年11月24日登陆PlayStation 5和Xbox Series X|S，售价24.99美元。想要完整体验拍卖的玩家还可以购买“概不退款版”。该版本包含游戏本体和扩展通行证，通行证里有多个主题DLC，例如《后院入门包》和《收藏品展示包》。\n\n“概不退款版”将在包括PC在内的所有平台推出，售价34.99美元。不过，扩展通行证也可以单独购买，售价16.99美元。在游戏里，玩家会走遍城镇参加拍卖会，与其他竞拍者争夺车库、储物间和集装箱。每场拍卖都可能藏着惊喜，所以玩家必须发掘宝物才能赚钱。\n\n游戏中有数千种独特物品等待发现，专家可以鉴定它们的价值。随着生意发展，玩家会解锁自行估价的工具。玩家还能买下典当行、升级设施并雇用员工，因为妥善管理资源很重要。游戏提供轻松和困难两种模式，还有成就可供炫耀。\n\n你不必独自寻宝，因为最多三位好友可以加入合作冒险，并随时加入或退出。队员们共用一个银行账户，所以计划周全的队伍才能获胜。他们也可以分头前往不同的拍卖现场，从而赚到更多钱。游戏提供七种载具，玩家必须管理好后备箱空间和燃油。", "text": "Storage Hunter Simulator will arrive on PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S on November 24, 2026, and it will cost $24.99. Players who want the full auction experience can also buy the No Refunds Edition. That version includes the base game and an expansion pass with several themed DLC packs, such as the Backyard Starter Pack and the Collectibles Display Pack. The No Refunds Edition will launch on all platforms, including PC, for $34.99. However, the expansion pass is also sold separately for $16.99. In the game, players travel around town to auctions and compete with other bidders for garages, storage rooms and shipping containers. Each auction may hide a surprise, so players must find treasure and turn a profit. There are thousands of unique items to discover, and experts can check what they are worth. As the business grows, players unlock tools to value items themselves. They can also buy a pawn shop, upgrade facilities and hire staff, because good resource management matters. The game offers an easy mode and a hard mode, plus achievements to show off. You do not have to hunt alone, because up to three friends can join a co-op adventure and drop in or out at any time. Players share one bank account, so teams that plan well will win.", "vocab": [{"word": "auction", "pos": "noun", "zh": "拍卖", "note": "常与 at an auction 搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "bidder", "pos": "noun", "zh": "竞拍者", "note": "动词形式为 bid", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "storage", "pos": "noun", "zh": "仓储；储物", "note": "storage unit 指储物间", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "expansion pass", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "扩展通行证", "note": "游戏术语，包含后续DLC", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "unique", "pos": "adj", "zh": "独特的", "note": "强调独一无二", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "profit", "pos": "noun", "zh": "利润", "note": "turn a profit 意为盈利", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "unlock", "pos": "verb", "zh": "解锁", "note": "游戏中常用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "facility", "pos": "noun", "zh": "设施", "note": "复数 facilities", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "co-op", "pos": "adj", "zh": "合作的", "note": "co-op adventure 合作冒险", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "manage", "pos": "verb", "zh": "管理", "note": "manage resources 管理资源", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-05T01:37:37.647708", "